From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Neogram Patchset <patches@neogram.invalid>
Subject: feature/hide-all-chats-tab: hide the All Chats folder tab

Behind NeoOptions.HIDE_ALL_CHATS_TAB. updateFilterTabs leaves the default filter out of the tab strip unless the tabs are being reordered: the stock reorder code takes tab positions for folder indices, so All Chats comes back for editing and showDoneItem rebuilds the strip when editing starts or ends. A selected tab that is no longer there falls back to the first unlocked folder. FilterTabsView.getStableId looks the tab up by id (the same in stock, where ids equal positions), onMeasure lays the tabs out without a default tab, and scrollToFolder maps the folder index to its tab position. The archive is reachable from the chat list menu (stock ApplicationLoader.addItemOptions).
